 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? That's sweet, and there are several apps that make it easy. Which operating system is your friend using? Great. There are few ways to go about it. You can buy a kit with fresh ingredients and follow a video, or you can mix your own mix from dry ingredients. Roughly $10 for a kit, or few dollars for each of the dry ingredients if you make your own. The kit is usually the way to go if you're worried about it being perfect. People usually heat the mix in the palm of your hand until it starts to bubble. Then they pour it over a spoonful of warm milk. People also sometimes top it with a layer of chocolate or a spoonful of whipped cream.",
